mesta počas jedinej noci.

1631
02:21:59.600 --> 02:22:01.840
Zabijem ťa!

1632
02:22:07.670 --> 02:22:08.990
Zabijem ťa!

1633
02:22:18.430 --> 02:22:18.510
A!

1634
02:22:19.190 --> 02:22:20.190
A!

1635
02:22:26.990 --> 02:22:27.990
A!

1636
02:22:38.800 --> 02:22:39.800
A!

1637
02:22:40.460 --> 02:22:41.860
A!

1638
02:22:43.260 --> 02:22:44.260
A!

